artfct-pstack
=============

artfct-pstack is an add-on that works alongside pstack
(https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack, MIT, copyright Lauren Tan,
author handle poteto). It is not a rebrand of pstack, and it is not endorsed by
Cursor or Lauren Tan.

